      "pronunciationText": "Here's what you'll record. Lithium gives a crimson red. Sodium, a bright yellow-orange. Potassium, a pale lilac. Calcium, an orange-red. Strontium, a deep red, a lot like lithium's. Barium, a pale green. And copper, a blue-green.",
